Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.61,0:22:27.66,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}Everything melts into the dead of night
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:32.92,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}As if even gravity fades away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.67,0:22:39.17,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.17,0:22:43.68,ED - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur5}「寂しい」忘れちゃう夜だ
